{
  "sourceLanguage": "sv",
  "strings": {
    "%lld appar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld av %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld of %2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld meddelanden till byggaren i månaden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld messages to the builder a month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld/%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld/%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 app": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Skaffa ett utvecklarkonto": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Get a developer account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Skapa en nyckel": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Create a key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Koppla nyckeln": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Connect the key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI-tjänsten svarar inte just nu. Försök igen om en stund.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The AI service is not answering right now. Try again in a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alla appar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alla knappar trycks på, en efter en": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every button is pressed, one after another"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allt är inte ifyllt än.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not everything is filled in yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ange en giltig e-postadress och ett lösenord på minst 8 tecken.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a valid email address and a password of at least 8 characters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Dance": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Dance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Dance visar dem": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Dance shows them"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Store": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Store"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Store-guiden ingår i planen Publicera. Du ber om den under Min plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The App Store guide is part of the plan Publish. You ask for it under My plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appar att skapa i App Store Connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps to create in App Store Connect"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen behöver läggas upp hos Apple av den som driver tjänsten. Det görs för hand, så det kan ta en stund. Du behöver inte göra något.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has to be set up with Apple by whoever runs the service. That is done by hand, so it can take a while. You do not need to do anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen byggs om i chatten. En ny version för telefonen görs klar av sig själv när det är färdigt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is being rebuilt in the chat. A new version for the phone is made ready by itself when that is done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen finns i TestFlight om några minuter": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is in TestFlight in a few minutes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen finns inte i App Store Connect än. Gör den installerbar först; då får du hjälp att skapa den.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app does not exist in App Store Connect yet. Make it installable first; that walks you through creating it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen finns inte i App Store Connect än. Skapa en ny app där med bundle-id %@ och försök sedan igen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app does not exist in App Store Connect yet. Create a new app there with the bundle ID %@ and then try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen får ett minne, så att inget försvinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app gets a memory, so nothing is lost"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen gick inte att bygga. Be om en rättning i chatten och försök igen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app could not be built. Ask for a fix in the chat and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen går inte att bygga just nu. Be om en rättning i chatten och försök igen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app cannot be built right now. Ask for a fix in the chat and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen görs klar för din telefon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is being made ready for your phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen har ingen version som väntar på att skickas in. Den kan redan vara inskickad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has no version waiting to be submitted. It may already have been submitted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen hittades inte.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app was not found."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen innehåller inget av det Apple frågar om för åldersgränsen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has none of the content Apple asks about for the age rating"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen laddas upp till ditt konto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is being uploaded to your account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen ligger på din hemskärm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is on your home screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen lämnas till Apples granskning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is being handed to Apple's review."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen på din egen telefon": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app on your own phone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen på telefonen ingår i planen Skapa. Du ber om den under Min plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app on your phone is part of the plan Create. You ask for it under My plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen ska vara gratis och finnas i alla länder": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app should be free and available in every country"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen skickas nu in till Apple för granskning, i utvecklarkontots namn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is now submitted to Apple for review, in the developer account's name."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen startas på en provtelefon": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is started on a test phone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen visar inget material från andra som jag saknar rätt att använda": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app shows no material from others that I lack the rights to use"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är för stor för att skriva ett förslag i ett steg.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is too large to write a suggestion in one step."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är inskickad för granskning. Apple hör av sig till kontaktpersonen, oftast inom ett par dagar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has been submitted for review. Apple gets in touch with the contact person, usually within a couple of days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är inskickad till Apple.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has been handed in to Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är inte uppladdad än.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has not been uploaded yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen är inte uppladdad än. Gör den installerbar först, så finns det ett bygge att välja.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has not been uploaded yet. Make it installable first, so there is a build to select."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appen öppnas hos dig så fort den är klar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app opens for you the moment it is done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appens skärm i simulatorn": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app's screen in the simulator"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appens version granskas eller är redan släppt, så sidan kan inte ändras härifrån.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app's version is in review or already released, so the page cannot be changed from here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appikon": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App icon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple bearbetar fortfarande bygget %@. Skicka sidan igen om några minuter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple is still processing build %@. Send the page again in a few minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte allt på sidan: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not accept everything on the page: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte appen för test. Den som driver tjänsten har fått veta varför.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not approve the app for testing. Whoever runs the service has been told why."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte nyckeln till utvecklarkontot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not accept the key to the developer account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte nyckeln. Kontrollera App Store Connect-nyckeln.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not accept the key. Check the App Store Connect key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte nyckeln. Kontrollera att Key ID och Issuer ID hör till just den här filen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not accept the key. Check that the Key ID and Issuer ID belong to this very file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple godkände inte nyckeln. Kontrollera kopplingen till utvecklarkontot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not accept the key. Check the connection to the developer account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple granskar appen, oftast inom ett par dagar, och säger till när den är godkänd.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple reviews the app, usually within a couple of days, and tells you when it is approved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple går igenom appen innan länken får användas. Första gången kan det ta upp till ett par dagar; nya versioner går fortare.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple looks the app over before the link may be used. The first time that can take up to a couple of days; new versions go faster."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple har skickat en inbjudan till %@. Öppna mejlet och tacka ja. Sedan kommer appen till TestFlight inom några minuter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple has sent an invitation to %@. Open the email and accept. The app then reaches TestFlight within a few minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple har tagit emot telefonen men släpper inte in den i appar än. Det kan ta upp till tre dygn i ett nytt konto. Försök igen senare.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple has taken the phone in but does not let it into apps yet. That can take up to three days in a new account. Try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple hör av sig till den här personen om något är oklart. Uppgifterna används för alla dina appar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple gets in touch with this person if something is unclear. The details are used for all your apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple kräver att varje app har en supportsida och en integritetspolicy på webben.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple requires every app to have a support page and a privacy policy on the web."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple kräver båda. E-postadressen visas öppet på sidorna, tillsammans med ditt namn om du har fyllt i kontaktuppgifterna. Du ansvarar för att policyn stämmer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple requires both. The email address is shown openly on the pages, together with your name if you have filled in the contact details. You answer for the policy being true."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple tar emot appen. Det tar oftast en kvart. Du kan stänga den här rutan under tiden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple is receiving the app. That usually takes a quarter of an hour. You can close this in the meantime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple tog inte emot appen än: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not take the app yet: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple vill veta vem de kan kontakta om appen. Fyll i det här en gång, så används det för alla dina appar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple wants to know who to contact about the app. Fill this in once, and it is used for all your apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple vill veta vilka uppgifter appen samlar in. Det går bara att svara på hos Apple, under App Privacy på appens sida där.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple wants to know what the app collects. That can only be answered at Apple, under App Privacy on the app's page there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple visade inte vilket team kontot har. Fyll i ditt Team ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple did not show which team the account has. Fill in your Team ID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple-utvecklarkonto": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple developer account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avbryt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Behöver du en idé?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Need an idea?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskriv din app med egna ord": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe your app in your own words"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskriv din app.\nSe den bli till.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe your app.\nWatch it come to life."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskriv din idé": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe your idea"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskriv din idé. Få en riktig iPhone-app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe your idea. Get a real iPhone app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskriv vad du vill ändra eller lägga till": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe what you want to change or add"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskrivning": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Description"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beskrivningen är för lång": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The description is too long"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bestämmer vilka skärmar appen behöver": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deciding which screens the app needs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Betalning är inte påslagen än. När du ber om en plan slår vi på den åt dig.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Payment is not turned on yet. When you ask for a plan, we turn it on for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bilden görs kvadratisk och används från nästa version du gör installerbar. Utan egen ikon får appen en enkel platshållare.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The picture is made square and used from the next version you make installable. Without an icon of its own the app gets a simple placeholder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bjud in mig som testare": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invite me as a tester"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blev det som du bad om?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Did it turn out the way you asked?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bli medlem hos Apple": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Join Apple's developer programme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygg en ny version": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Build a new version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygg för den här telefonen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Build for this phone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygg min app": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Build my app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygger appen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Building the app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygger appen för din telefon": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Building the app for your phone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bygger för iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Building for iPhone"
